{"3543420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "QUIET DAN", "steam_appid": 3543420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Quiet Dan”</strong> is a provocative work in the format of a visual novel, blurring the boundaries between ordinariness and existential crisis. The protagonist, Dan, a resident of suburban New York City, loses his job as a janitor and sinks into an abyss of loneliness, inner demons, and social injustice. His actions are contradictory and sometimes violent, making the narrative suspenseful and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.poster.avif?t=1756456110\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.webm?t=1756456110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.mp4?t=1756456110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced one-man performance:</strong> the entire text of the novel is fully voiced and dictated on the fly, without subsequent edits, which gives the story liveliness and a sense of “raw” reality. This creates the effect of a theatrical monologue, where Dan's thoughts and dialogues sound as natural as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre mix:</strong> includes elements of psychological thriller, social drama and philosophical nonconformism. The work has been compared to «American Psycho» and «Fight Club» for its dark atmosphere and exploration of human degradation.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Quiet Dan”</strong> is 